{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"60d334d1978c4ca4","__entryId":"centering","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:152px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px\">\n      <div style=\"width:220px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px\">登录 Vibe</div>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:8px\" value=\"you@example.com\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%\">登 录</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:140px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/empty-box.png\" style=\"width:66px;height:52px;object-fit:contain\" alt=\"\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px\">暂无收藏</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">去逛逛，把喜欢的组件收藏起来</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:12px 0 14px\">\n      <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">新功能上线</span>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin:10px 0 5px\">像聊天一样写前端</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:12px\">描述你想要的效果，剩下的交给 AI</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">立即体验</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-text\">查看演示 →</button>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;height:150px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:58%;background:var(--bg);border-left:1px solid var(--border-light);border-right:1px solid var(--border-light);padding:12px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">为什么居中这么难？</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:96%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:152px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px\">\n      <div style=\"width:220px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px\">Login Vibe</div>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:8px\" value=\"you@example.com\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%\">Log in</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:140px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/empty-box.png\" style=\"width:66px;height:52px;object-fit:contain\" alt=\"\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px\">No favorites yet</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">Go shopping and collect your favorite components</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:12px 0 14px\">\n      <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">New feature available</span>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin:10px 0 5px\">Write the front end like chat</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:12px\">Describe the effect you want and leave the rest to AI</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Try it now</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-text\">View demo →</button>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;height:150px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:58%;background:var(--bg);border-left:1px solid var(--border-light);border-right:1px solid var(--border-light);padding:12px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Why is centering so difficult? </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:96%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ctr-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"container\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-item\">元素</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ctr-anat-axes\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"main\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-axis\">主轴：justify-content: center</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cross\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-axis\">交叉轴：align-items: center</span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ctr-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"container\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-item\">Element</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ctr-anat-axes\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"main\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-axis\">Main axis: justify-content: center</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cross\"><span class=\"ctr-anat-axis\">Cross axis: align-items: center</span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"container","cn":"容器","en":"Container","desc":"写上 display: flex 的父元素，居中都是它说了算","desc_en":"Set display: flex on the parent so it controls how its children are aligned."},{"key":"item","cn":"居中元素","en":"Centered Item","desc":"被放到正中间的那个子元素","desc_en":"The child element being centered"},{"key":"main","cn":"主轴对齐","en":"Justify Content","desc":"justify-content: center，管主轴方向的居中","desc_en":"justify-content: center aligns the child along the main axis."},{"key":"cross","cn":"交叉轴对齐","en":"Align Items","desc":"align-items: center，管交叉轴方向的居中","desc_en":"align-items: center aligns the child along the cross axis."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"Flex 居中","en":"Flex","demo":"<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\"></span></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\"></span></span>","when":"普通容器中最常用的居中方法","when_en":"The most commonly used centering method in ordinary containers"},{"cn":"Grid 居中","en":"Grid","demo":"<span style=\"display:grid;place-items:center;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\"></span></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:grid;place-items:center;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\"></span></span>","when":"父元素已经是 grid 时最省字","when_en":"It is most economical when the parent element is already grid"},{"cn":"绝对定位居中","en":"Absolute","demo":"<span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)\"></span></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)\"></span></span>","when":"老代码里常见，能认出来就行","when_en":"It’s common in old codes, just recognize it"}],"use":[{"t":"父容器使用 Flex 时，在两条轴上设置居中","m":"flex-center"},{"t":"父容器使用 Grid 时，可以用 place-items 居中","m":"ctr-grid"},{"t":"<b>文字水平居中</b>：text-align: center，只管水平方向","m":"ctr-text"},{"t":"<b>定宽块级元素水平居中</b>：margin: 0 auto，见 {c:margin}","m":"margin-auto"}],"dont":[{"t":"为普通布局优先用 <b>flex 或 grid</b>：table/table-cell 仍可用于兼容旧实现或表格语义，不必一概否定","m":"ctr-table","bad":true},{"t":"不要用多处 <b>margin 固定偏移</b>定位：容器宽度变化时会失准","m":"ctr-margin-hack","bad":true},{"t":"绝对定位居中还要用 transform 修正元素自身尺寸","m":"ctr-abs-half","bad":true},{"t":"块级元素撑满宽度时，自动外边距看不出居中效果","m":"ctr-auto-nowidth","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"空状态的图标和文案高度会随语言变化，但它们要始终在内容区域水平、垂直居中。怎样实现更合适？","options":[{"id":"parent-axis-centering","label":"让父容器使用 Flex 或 Grid，在水平和垂直两条轴上居中","feedback":"父级对齐不依赖空状态自身尺寸，内容变高、容器变宽时仍能保持双轴居中。","correct":true},{"id":"fixed-margins","label":"根据当前截图给空状态写固定上外边距和左外边距","feedback":"固定偏移只匹配当前尺寸，语言、视口或内容高度变化后中心位置会失准。","correct":false},{"id":"absolute-fixed-offsets","label":"把内容绝对定位到一组固定 top 和 left 数值，不考虑自身大小","feedback":"固定坐标没有补偿元素自身宽高，也不能跟随容器尺寸变化保持真正居中。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"An empty state's icon and copy change height by language, but must stay horizontally and vertically centered in the content area. What is the better approach?","options":[{"id":"parent-axis-centering","label":"Use Flex or Grid on the parent and center along both horizontal and vertical axes","feedback":"Parent alignment does not depend on the empty state's own size, so it remains centered as content and container change.","correct":true},{"id":"fixed-margins","label":"Set fixed top and left margins based on the current screenshot","feedback":"Fixed offsets only fit the current dimensions and drift when language, viewport, or content height changes.","correct":false},{"id":"absolute-fixed-offsets","label":"Absolutely position the content at fixed top and left values without considering its size","feedback":"Fixed coordinates do not compensate for the element's own dimensions or adapt to its container.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请在空状态的父容器上使用 Flex 或 Grid 做水平、垂直居中，不要用截图对应的固定 margin 或坐标。确保容器有明确可用高度，并用中英文、手机宽度和长文案验证中心位置不变。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Center the empty state through Flex or Grid on its parent, not screenshot-specific margins or coordinates. Ensure the container has a defined available height, then test Chinese, English, mobile width, and long copy."}},"references":[{"title":"CSS 居中完全指南","source":"CSS-Tricks","url":"https://css-tricks.com/centering-css-complete-guide/","title_en":"Centering in CSS: A Complete Guide"}],"scenes":["登录卡片放页面正中","空状态插图居中","标题文字居中","定宽容器水平居中"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Center text inside a heading or button","m":"flex-center"},{"t":"Center a fixed-width content column","m":"ctr-grid"},{"t":"Center an empty state in a panel","m":"ctr-text"},{"t":"Align an item on both axes in a known container","m":"margin-auto"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use absolute offsets without knowing the container size","m":"ctr-table","bad":true},{"t":"Center long body text when left alignment is easier to read","m":"ctr-margin-hack","bad":true},{"t":"Add spaces or line breaks until something looks centered","m":"ctr-abs-half","bad":true},{"t":"Apply centering to the whole page when only one child needs it","m":"ctr-auto-nowidth","bad":true}],"scenes":["Empty state","Dialog content","Login panel","Loading indicator"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:152px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px\">\n      <div style=\"width:220px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px\">Login Vibe</div>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:8px\" value=\"you@example.com\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%\">Log in</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:140px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/empty-box.png\" style=\"width:66px;height:52px;object-fit:contain\" alt=\"\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px\">No favorites yet</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">Go shopping and collect your favorite components</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:12px 0 14px\">\n      <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">New feature available</span>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin:10px 0 5px\">Write the front end like chat</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:12px\">Describe the effect you want and leave the rest to AI</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Try it now</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-text\">View demo →</button>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;height:150px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:58%;background:var(--bg);border-left:1px solid var(--border-light);border-right:1px solid var(--border-light);padding:12px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Why is centering so difficult? </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:96%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\"></span></span>","when":"The most commonly used centering method in ordinary containers"},{"demo":"<span style=\"display:grid;place-items:center;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\"></span></span>","when":"It is most economical when the parent element is already grid"},{"demo":"<span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:76px;height:46px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px\"><span class=\"ctr-v-item\" style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)\"></span></span>","when":"It’s common in old codes, just recognize it"}]},"usageMocks":{"flex-center":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">登录</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">主轴与交叉轴都设为 center</span></div>","ctr-grid":"<div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:grid;place-items:center;width:52px;height:40px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px\"><span style=\"width:16px;height:16px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:130px\">display: grid + place-items: center，两行收工</span></div>","ctr-text":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);text-align:center\">标题水平居中</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">text-align: center 只管水平方向</span></div>","margin-auto":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:58%;height:18px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:4px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center\">margin: 0 auto，定宽块自动居中</span></div>","ctr-table":"<div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:table;width:52px;height:40px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:5px\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:120px\">table-cell 能居中；新布局通常用 flex 或 grid 更直接</span></div>","ctr-margin-hack":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:42px;height:14px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px;margin-left:38px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">用固定 margin 定位，容器变宽后会偏移</span></div>","ctr-abs-half":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"position:relative;height:54px\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:26px;height:16px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;bottom:2px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">只写 left/top: 50%，元素从中心往右下长</span></div>","ctr-auto-nowidth":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;height:14px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px;margin:0 auto\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">宽度没定死，margin: 0 auto 居不了中</span></div>"}}}